---
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro";
import HereditaryHorizontal from "../assets/logos/hereditary-horizontal-logo.png";
import FundedByEU from "../assets/logos/funded-by-the-eu.png";
---

<div class="footer-logos">
  <Image src={HereditaryHorizontal} alt="Hereditary Project Logo" />
  <Image src={FundedByEU} alt="Funded by the European Union" />
</div>

This project has received funding from the European Union's Horizon Europe
research and innovation programme under grant agreement No GA 101137074. Views
and opinions expressed are however those of the author(s) only and do not
necessarily reflect those of the European Union. Neither the European Union nor
the granting authority can be held responsible for them. This project has
received support from the EOSC EU Node.

<style lang="scss">
  .footer-logos {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between; /* pushes images to left and right */
    align-items: center; /* vertically center if container taller */
    gap: 20px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    height: 80px;
    margin-bottom: 1.5%;

    img {
      margin: 0;
      height: 100%; /* match container height */
      width: auto; /* preserve aspect ratio */
      max-width: 45%; /* optional safeguard so a very wide image doesn't overlap */
      object-fit: contain; /* safe fallback for replaced elements */
      display: block;
    }
  }
</style>
